flowchart LR
    H[Write the hypothesis] --> I[Inject one bounded fault]
    I --> M[Measure against the hypothesis]
    M --> L[Learn: fix or refine]
    L --> H
    A[Abort on customer harm] -.-> I
    A -.-> M

    style H fill:#e1f5ff,stroke:#1565c0
    style I fill:#fff9c4,stroke:#f57f17,stroke-width:2px
    style M fill:#e1f5ff,stroke:#1565c0
    style L fill:#c8e6c9,stroke:#2e7d32
    style A fill:#ffcdd2,stroke:#c62828,stroke-width:2px
